                <pb facs="1126" n="976" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg976"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 4757/1.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Riddle to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-02-22"><hi rendition="#italic">February 22,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Russian Red Cross is carrying on relief measures and has furnished 3,000,000
                    roubles in last six months, but would nevertheless be grateful for any outside
                    aid.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Riddle.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
